 0.23 ceiling (exp4188)? LATENT (lift CI excl 0) -> full LoRA-distill viable
 (.391); ABSENT -> need a stronger base. verifier_is_oracle=true (GAP-4
 execution certifier). NO full fine-tune this milestone.

